    <string name="tip">Tip</string>
    <string name="tip_shake">Shaking chills, dilutes and aerates. Shake hard with plenty of ice – more ice means less watery drinks.</string>
    <string name="tip_stir">Stir spirit-only drinks for a silky, clear texture. Hold the bar spoon loosely and let it glide around the glass.</string>
    <string name="tip_dry">Dry shake = shaking without ice first. It whips the egg white into a thick foam.</string>
    <string name="tip_muddle">Press gently – crushed mint leaves turn bitter.</string>
    <string name="tip_build">Built drinks are made directly in the glass. Pour the bubbly mixer last to keep the fizz.</string>
    <string name="tip_layer">Pour slowly over the back of a spoon held just above the previous layer.</string>
    <string name="tip_blend">Add liquids first, then ice – the blender runs smoother.</string>
